OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man dies in crash on
OL,4,Amajor route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and another has been
OL,7,Farrested after two cars crashed on a
OL,8,Fmajor route, leaving the road partially
OL,9,Fclosed.
OL,11,FHampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FConstabulary said it was called to the
OL,13,Ftwo-car collision on the A34
OL,14,Fsouthbound, near Sutton Scotney, at
OL,15,Fabout 20:20 BST on Saturday evening.
OL,17,FThe force said a man in his 60s was
OL,18,Fpronounced dead at the scene, and a
OL,19,F21-year-old man from Wiltshire was
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,21,Fby driving whilst unfit through drugs.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
