OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after man dies in crash on
OL,4,Amajor route
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe route, which is one of the major
OL,7,Farteries linking the south coast with
OL,8,Fthe Midlands, remains closed southbound
OL,9,Fbetween the A303 Bullington Interchange
OL,10,Fand junction 9 of the M3.
